Chromium 159.0.8154.11 -> 159.0.8154.19, for the 159.0.8154.11 tarball.

159.0.8154.19 is a tag on the 159 branch (refs/branch-heads/8154@{#891}) that
has no source tarball (as of 2026-11-18). It adds 368 branch commits to
159.0.8154.11 (#523), the newest tag with a tarball, among them PGO/orderfile/AFDO
rolls, translation updates and VERSION increments. It adds, among many CHECKs turned
back into DCHECKs and Omnibox, Contextual Tasks, OTP, Glic, Actor and New Tab Page
changes: IndexedDB's transaction scope enforced in the browser, WebMediaPlayerMS's
validity checked during frame copies, WebCodecs' callbacks routed to the execution
context's task runners, Autofill's selected option text lengths validated, the
resource sets snapshotted before iterating in ResourceFetcher, the DOM mutations
handled during text replacement in editing commands, PointerEvents retargeted across
shadow boundaries, the WebTransport close during handshake; in the dependency rolls:
ANGLE's texture ID recreated before glTexStorage and its texture size limit enforced,
struct constructors wrapped after return in the translator.

Generated from the upstream diffs between the tags: chromium/src
refs/tags/159.0.8154.11..159.0.8154.19 and the dependencies whose DEPS revision
changed (V8 f96ec3d87612..4593f4dc1e9b, Skia 7a06b6cf9fc9..8a65fa27c104, Dawn
d76611e189de..e8069b445d6e, ANGLE a18497974ed5..0f0b90f0b5bf, LevelDB
bb74ef739973..29465588d3df, DevTools bc93449ab187..3d48567555b6,
search_engines_data 5dc9f1afd38a..54e52a25f584), as served by Gitiles, with
scripts/chromium-delta. ICU's DEPS revision doesn't change (the .11 tarball has it).

Left out, as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release
tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs,
translations (but en-GB), CI configuration, PGO/orderfile pointers, submodule
pointer updates, DEPS. GN files (*.gn, *.gni) are kept even for tests and other
platforms: gn gen reads test targets' BUILD.gn too.

Added: the tarball's stamp files for the new commit (stamps.py:
build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime}, gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h,
skia/ext/skia_commit_hash.h, gpu/webgpu/DAWN_VERSION and
gpu/webgpu/dawn_commit_hash.h; commit 43140624db7d3db9416ae42b1392b84c73792e1a,
refs/branch-heads/8154@{#891}). build/util/MINIBRANCH doesn't change.

Checked: applies to the 159.0.8154.11 tarball; chrome/VERSION becomes
159.0.8154.19; every patched source file is byte-identical to its version
at the tag (or its dependency's DEPS revision); it adds 38 files and deletes 1
(chrome/browser/resources/omnibox_everywhere/browser_proxy.ts); the
159.0.8154.11 tarball's non-git files are all classified (tarball-generated.py with
generated.conf); with the branch fixes, the resulting files are identical to the
159.0.8154.6 tarball with chromium-159.0.8154.6-to-159.0.8154.19.patch.

Apply with git apply.

