+    the Drive consent dialog. Recorded once per load, when it ends. A load
+    starts when the consent flow opens ConsentKit, or when the user clicks
+    &quot;Try again&quot; on the error screen. It ends when ConsentKit sends
+    UI_RENDERED_EVENT, or when the dialog stops waiting after 5 seconds and
+    shows the error screen. Any message from ConsentKit stops the wait, so a
